{
  "abstract": "The principal results and substantive corollaries of the included paper on coordinate projection areas: rank-three nonapproximation despite realizable four-coordinate restrictions, compatibility of boundary quartets, escape-cone and closure identities, strict realization by centrally symmetric polytopes with the actual vertex bound, weighted obstructions, open nonrealizable families, and the nonnegative rank-at-most-three classification.",
